==Battleground==
*2 [[Boulder]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[White Wind]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[White Wind]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Red Wind]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Wind]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Dark Wind]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**4 [[White Wind]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**4 [[Red Wind]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**6 [[Boulder]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**6 [[Boulder]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
**6 [[Boulder]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**6 [[Boulder]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
An easy stage, despite their decent health pool, none of the enemies can really push, so [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|C. Bahamut]] or [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|Valkyrie]] if you lack Bahamut can clear the enemy stack.

